<div class="frpg1e-card surprise-card">
  <div class="card-title">Surprise</div>
  <ul class="init-list">
    <li><strong>Party</strong> rolled <span class="adnd-big">{{party}}</span> {{#if pS}}<em>surprised</em>{{/if}}</li>
    <li><strong>Monsters</strong> rolled <span class="adnd-big">{{foe}}</span> {{#if mS}}<em>surprised</em>{{/if}}</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="verdict">{{text}}</p>
  <p class="hint">Surprised on 1-{{partyChance}} (party) and 1-{{foeChance}} (monsters). Adjust for rangers, monsters and dexterity per DMG p.61-62.</p>
</div>
